                      (    forth6809.asm):07453                                      ; time). Answers HOLDMINSIZE (34), not the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07454                                      ; larger PADOFFSET (128) - HOLDMINSIZE is
                      (    forth6809.asm):07455                                      ; specifically the portion of the
