                      (    forth6809.asm):07473                                      ; is returned by PAD") - PAD's own region,
                      (    forth6809.asm):07474                                      ; growing upward from PAD itself, distinct
                      (    forth6809.asm):07475                                      ; from HOLDMINSIZE above (which answers
                      (    forth6809.asm):07476                                      ; for a different region entirely, the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07477                                      ; downward-growing pictured-numeric buffer
                      (    forth6809.asm):07478                                      ; in the CODEHERE-to-PAD gap). PADOFFSET
                      (    forth6809.asm):07479                                      ; happens to equal PADMINSIZE numerically
                      (    forth6809.asm):07480                                      ; in this implementation (PADOFFSET EQU
                      (    forth6809.asm):07481                                      ; PADMINSIZE), but /PAD is answered with
                      (    forth6809.asm):07482                                      ; the conceptually correct constant, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):07483                                      ; the coincidentally-equal one.
FC47 FC9400070000     (    forth6809.asm):07484                  FDB   EN9,EN9L,0    ; NEW: FLOORED - previously the one item
                      (    forth6809.asm):07485                                      ; in this area explicitly left open
                      (    forth6809.asm):07486                                      ; pending its own investigation (unlike
                      (    forth6809.asm):07487                                      ; WORDLISTS, this is a CORE query, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):07488                                      ; tied to an unimplemented optional word
                      (    forth6809.asm):07489                                      ; set, so "false by omission" wasn't the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07490                                      ; right default). Investigated by tracing
                      (    forth6809.asm):07491                                      ; DIVCOMMON (shared by /, MOD, /MOD)
                      (    forth6809.asm):07492                                      ; against this system's own SM/REM and
                      (    forth6809.asm):07493                                      ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07494                                      ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07495                                      ; dividend's own original sign) after
                      (    forth6809.asm):07496                                      ; dividing absolute values - exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):07497                                      ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):07498                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):07499                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):07500                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07501                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07502                                      ; quotient would be negative with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):07503                                      ; nonzero remainder) that DIVCOMMON does
                      (    forth6809.asm):07504                                      ; not have. This system's primary
                      (    forth6809.asm):07505                                      ; division words (/, MOD, /MOD) use
                      (    forth6809.asm):07506                                      ; symmetric division, not floored -
                      (    forth6809.asm):07507                                      ; FLOORED is 0 (false), a real, meaningful
                      (    forth6809.asm):07508                                      ; answer (recognized query, value false),
                      (    forth6809.asm):07509                                      ; not the "unrecognized" fallthrough
                      (    forth6809.asm):07510                                      ; WORDLISTS correctly uses.
